<Layout title="Privacy policy — Good Apollo Goods" description="Good Apollo Goods privacy policy.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy policy." intro="A plain-language summary of how information is handled when you visit or shop with Good Apollo Goods." />
  <section class="container policy"><p class="policy-date">Last updated September 2026</p><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>When checkout and inquiry tools are active, Good Apollo Goods may receive the information needed to answer your message, fulfill an order, or provide customer support, such as your name, email, shipping address, and order details.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used only to operate the shop, complete purchases, communicate about orders or inquiries, and meet legal obligations. Good Apollo Goods does not sell personal information.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Hosting, payment, shipping, and analytics providers may process limited information as needed to provide their services. Their own privacy terms also apply.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@goodapollogoods.com">hello@goodapollogoods.com</a> with privacy questions.</p></section>
</Layout>
